83236841572", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825470_823483243508238_4221816796626891679_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P83AhMtdgeAQ7kNvwGt5t1h&_nc_oc=Adq2JR8iVeqO5GHPwg4Q-SuhU6wT4NEFqO957da6wEIXW_YGx16Bn21Xp4PkWvNmFhM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK1dlVlymM8fa0kH4Lix3um84BIqbUSoCGG9jvR8tKIFQ&oe=6AA69B0A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pumpkin Punch VR - Fun Punching Game", "keywords": ["PunchingGame", "HalloweenGame", "ActionGame", "FitnessGame", "VRHalloween"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate Halloween workout with Pumpkin Punch VR \u2013 Fun Punching Game! Put on your VR gloves and get ready to punch, smash, and destroy pumpkins flying toward you from every direction. It\u2019s simple, satisfying, and endlessly fun!\n\nEach level brings faster pumpkins, trickier patterns, and special Halloween surprises that keep you on your toes. With responsive VR motion tracking, dynamic visuals, and energetic sound effects, every punch feels powerful and rewarding.\n\nWhether you\u2019re looking for a quick VR fitness burst or just want to enjoy some lighthearted Halloween action, Pumpkin Punch VR delivers pure fun for all ages. Sharpen your reflexes, chase your high score, and punch your way through the spooky season! ", "short_description": "Get ready to punch, smash, and laugh in Pumpkin Punch VR \u2013 Fun Punching Game! Test your reflexes as you punch flying pumpkins and spooky surprises in this fast, fun, and festive VR experience!"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-games-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "co